# SHA-256 checksums for the model artefacts referenced by this repository.
#
# The two .onnx graphs ARE committed; the two .onnx.data weight blobs are NOT
# (see LICENSE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for why). These digests exist so that a
# blob obtained elsewhere can be checked against the exact bytes that produced
# every model-derived number reported in docs/ and experiments/results/.
#
# Verify from the repository root:   shasum -a 256 -c models/CHECKSUMS.sha256
# On a plain clone the two .data lines report 'No such file or directory'.
# This file records identity, not provenance: see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
# (Getting the weights) for what is and is not known about where they came from.
360b7b97765d1582ce0a83e1381e00228a63833647553149bbbd5a9ffb61809e  models/organs.onnx
0b96b9d1129129c3b0c3f4d761cdc26a3e52d607977c07336b893b88bfd312ce  models/organs.onnx.data
b4dd27e076e3253a626a480e0ff0a6d4cc807fa234ef7a0e14fa065f87f6921c  models/recon_dl_v20.onnx
76a183ea40d125fe7d335f4e9b7ea95c03b7ca5831cf29769fc36c3fd27a6e55  models/recon_dl_v20.onnx.data
